    "PERSISTENT DEVICE VAULT 2026-09-16: lib/track/store.ts rewritten — two pools: live sessions (2-min prune) + PERMANENT device_history_logs keyed by device_uuid (localStorage fingerprint, survives reboots/updates). Fields per spec: device_metadata, first_connection_time, last_seen_time (refreshed on 30s heartbeat + 60s-throttled pointer activity), approval_status PENDING/AUTHORIZED_TEACHER/REVOKED. Vault persists to .data/device_history_logs.json (gitignored) with debounced writes; survives server restarts. APIs: /api/session accepts device_uuid; GET ?device= handshake; /api/session/authorize mutates by device_uuid; /api/classwork verifies via session->device approval. /admin-devices now a historical ledger: filters All/Pending/Approved, sorted last_seen desc (today board on top), Online-now dots cross-referenced from live pool, Authorize Device / revoke buttons = permanent mutations streaming over SSE. Whiteboard handshake: SessionTracker caches sb-live-auth in localStorage for instant unlock; board chip now reads School Board Mode — Auto-Saving Live (red pulse dot, no emoji). Tested: tab close keeps ledger, 403 unauthorized, authorize persists, SSE streams. Pushed 9a3f6a2.",
